WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:15.910
<i>Huh? What was I doing?</i>

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:19.000
<i>Who is that?</i>

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:22.870
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.600
<i>Who...</i>

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.170
<i>am I again?</i>

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:32.460
<i>Huh?</i>

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:07.210
<b>Episode 7 
Dolls and Stuffed Animals</b>

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:09.100
What a mess!

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:14.000
The barrier never reacted at all.

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:16.330
How in the world did our enemy...

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:17.450
Who knows?

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:21.030
That's why I'm going to ask the one 
who seems to know everything.

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:23.940
Gil, Illya's been kidnapped!

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:26.290
You shouldn't do that.

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:30.500
I don't dislike tomboys, but they aren't 
well-matched to a morning nap—

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:34.710
Man, seriously.

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:39.380
Once I'm an adult again, you'll be 
the first I kill. No question about it.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:42.190
The rule in this country is to 
show no mercy to dunces.

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:43.680
Remember that.

00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:45.910
So what's going on?

00:02:45.910 --> 00:02:47.770
You said Illya-san was kidnapped?

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.390
The window was open, and Cards 
were scattered on her bed.

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:54.440
Under these circumstances, 
kidnapping is the only possibility.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:58.100
But our barrier for detecting 
enemies didn't react, either.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:00.420
There are no signs that it was broken.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:03.410
At any rate, the enemy couldn't have broken in.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:06.950
You're saying Illya got up and left on her own?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:08.630
Without telling us?

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:10.590
And through the window?

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.560
That's the only explanation I can imagine.

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:14.790
I'm telling you that's impossible!

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:16.380
Maybe they used it?

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:18.130
What?

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:21.840
When we infiltrated the Ainsworth castle,

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:25.380
we used a concealment cloth that blocks

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:28.490
all magical and visual detection.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:30.640
What about it?

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:34.650
Illya-san apparently left it in the 
castle among all the confusion.

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:36.610
Huh? What the heck?

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:41.440
It was lost and then stolen.
Really, when it rains, it pours.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:45.520
So you're saying Darius used the 
cloth to capture Illya-san?

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.740
That doesn't feel right, either.

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:53.390
Given the lack of coherence 
and the thoughtless timing,

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.930
the culprit's probably...

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:07.760
Finished brainwashing her?

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.060
I failed.

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:12.100
<i>Brainwashing?</i>

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:14.290
You failed?

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:17.200
There's one region I can't interfere with,

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.680
and she has withdrawn her memories there.

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:22.530
An empty region.

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:26.400
It's like a personality used to be there, but left.

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:30.250
<i>Right... I remember now.</i>

00:04:30.890 --> 00:04:33.710
<i>I was kidnapped.</i>

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:37.440
I don't get it.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:39.150
What do we do?

00:04:39.150 --> 00:04:42.540
We should use the method we 
employed the other day.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:44.580
Oh, I see!

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.530
<i>Kidnapped and brainwashed?</i>

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:47.380
You're great at that, Angelica!

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:47.640
<i>How underhanded.</i>

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:51.150
Yes, I originally specialized 
in substitution magic.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:51.130
<i>I have to protect my mind!</i>

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:56.100
<i>I won't let these people brainwash me!</i>

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:59.420
<i>I'll never lose—</i>

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:00.960
<i>Huh?</i>

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.100
So Illya-oneechan's in here?

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:12.670
<i>Huh? Huh? Huh?!</i>

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:14.520
The transference is complete.

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:17.330
Illyasviel's mind is now in that stuffed animal,

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:20.600
and I placed a fake personality in her body.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:22.840
<i>Transference?</i>

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.320
<i>She moved my mind?</i>

00:05:24.320 --> 00:05:25.920
<i>They can do that?</i>

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:27.070
<i>The cowards!</i>

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:29.430
<i>Or so I'd like to say, but I can't speak!</i>

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.280
<i>My body won't move at all, either!</i>

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:34.960
It seems there's an air of confusion about her.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:37.580
I'm sorry for suddenly bringing you here.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:40.440
I wanted to finish this while Papa slept.

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:41.940
<i>What?</i>

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:46.550
Miyu-oneechan told me she 
preferred to be with you.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:50.970
But we can't let Miyu-oneechan leave, right?

00:05:50.970 --> 00:05:52.950
So I asked Angelica for a favor.

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:56.530
But Papa wouldn't let you stay here like that,

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:57.810
so we rendered you powerless.

00:05:57.810 --> 00:06:00.380
If you're a stuffed animal, 
Papa should let you stay!

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.100
Isn't that great?

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:05.280
Now you two can be together forever!

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:08.420
<i>Th-This girl genuinely believes that...</i>

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:10.890
<i>So innocently, without any malice!</i>

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:14.540
Now, let's show you to Onee-chan right away.

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.640
I'm sure she'll be happy!

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.390
Which should we show her?

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:22.480
Illyasviel's mind and body are separate now.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.430
Oh, right.

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:27.120
Hmm, which should we show?

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:28.430
Mind,

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:29.380
or body...

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:33.700
Which one is Illya-oneechan now?

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.930
<i>Wh-What are you saying?</i>

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.080
<i>That's obviously me—</i>

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.980
The contents have no meaning.

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:40.610
The vessel is what's important.

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:41.360
<i>Hey!</i>

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:42.130
Okay!

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:44.850
Then we'll take the body to her.

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:49.100
Uh, the one that's Illya-oneechan's body...

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:51.510
B-Body-oneechan!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.220
<i>Don't give it a weird name!</i>

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:56.720
Recognized. I am Body.

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.090
<i>It spoke?!</i>

00:06:58.090 --> 00:06:59.940
<i>And don't acknowledge that name!</i>

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:02.960
Now, Bodysviel, to Miyu-sama's room.

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:03.920
<i>What in the world?!</i>

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.720
<i>How can you all say such 
stupid things so seriously?!</i>

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:08.800
Mind-oneechan, watch the room for us.

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.340
We'll be back!

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:12.720
<i>They changed my name, too?!</i>

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:15.520
<i>Wait! Don't leave me!</i>

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:19.050
<i>Wh-What do I do?</i>

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:23.560
<i>This is a really bad situation...</i>

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.140
<i>Move, body!</i>

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:33.660
<i>N-No use.</i>

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:35.220
<i>It figures.</i>

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:39.750
<i>There's no way a cotton body 
like this could move.</i>

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:41.860
<i>I'm too powerless.</i>

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:44.800
<i>In the end, I couldn't do anything on my own.</i>

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:48.520
<i>Everything I've done so far has 
been because I had Ruby's help.</i>

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:53.780
Using your head like that is 
no good for a magical girl!

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:58.700
She's ignoring the logic and processes, 
but imagining the results.

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:02.710
That kind of mindless optimism 
is ideal for a magical girl!

00:08:03.700 --> 00:08:04.790
<i>I see...</i>

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:08.390
<i>If I assume it's impossible 
before I try, that's it.</i>

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.260
<i>What I need</i>

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:14.090
<i>is to believe I can do it!</i>

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:28.920
<i>I stood!</i>

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:30.110
<i>I stood up!</i>

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.360
<i>I can move!</i>

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:34.760
<i>With imagination and spirit, 
I really can do anything!</i>

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:36.240
<i>Th-This is no time to savor it.</i>

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:37.950
<i>I have to chase after my body!</i>

00:08:41.740 --> 00:08:43.540
<i>They were heading for Miyu.</i>

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:47.820
<i>Wait for me, Miyu! I'll get 
my body and come to you—</i>

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:51.300
Huh? What?

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:53.450
<i>Hey, of all people...</i>

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:56.950
What's a stuffed animal doing lying here?

00:08:58.030 --> 00:08:59.870
<i>Don't grind into me!</i>

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:03.440
Hey!

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:12.990
Still, you're cute!

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:14.520
<i>Huh?</i>

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.950
<i>Ah, she's taking me with her!</i>

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:25.120
<i>If I move now, she'll realize I'm inside</i>

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:27.370
<i>and rip me apart!</i>

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:29.380
Here we are.

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:31.240
This is my room.

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.210
Starting today, it's your home.

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.520
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:36.840
<i>Once I'm in her room, escape will be hard—</i>

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:42.760
<i>Wh-What's with this room?!</i>

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.980
I'm home, Julian-sama!

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:48.170
I'm sorry for leaving my room.

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:49.180
Were you lonely?

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:50.730
Hey, were you lonely?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.650
<i>What? Wh-Wh-Wha?</i>

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:57.190
B-Beako wasn't lonely at all.

00:09:57.750 --> 00:10:01.530
<i>Turn your pig face toward me, Beatrice.</i>

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:05.750
<i>Your filthy eyes should only reflect me.</i>

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:08.870
I'm so moe for Julian-tan when he talks tough!

00:10:06.970 --> 00:10:08.870
<i>What is this girl doing?!</i>

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:12.250
<i>Who's Julian? Some idol?</i>

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:16.840
<i>Seeing trash like you pisses me off.</i>

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:20.720
<i>Now, stay still... In my arms.</i>

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:22.330
Oh, man, this is great!

00:10:22.330 --> 00:10:24.130
I can make him say anything!

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:27.300
<i>Seeing trash like you pisses me off.</i>

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:27.740
Sampling Julian-sama's beautiful voice

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:31.190
and converting it to a voiceroid... 
I've been busy, busy!

00:10:28.110 --> 00:10:30.730
<i>Now, stay still... In my arms.</i>

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:33.260
<i>What have you been busy doing?!</i>

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:34.900
Further...

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:36.610
<i>Th-There's more?</i>

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:40.110
I have this nearly life-size 
"Sleep With Julian-sama" blanket!

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:42.470
Ah! No!

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:44.310
Julian-sama, I said, "No."

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:45.900
It's still morning.

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:48.160
Huh? You want to because it's morning?

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:52.080
Gosh, Julian-sama, you pervert!

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:54.390
"Don't talk, lowly swine."

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:57.050
<i>This is definitely a sight others shouldn't see.</i>

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:57.050
"You only need to do as I tell you."

00:10:57.730 --> 00:11:00.130
<i>But I didn't want to see it, either!</i>

00:10:58.680 --> 00:10:59.620
Yes!

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.740
Beako is your sow, Julian-sama!

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:03.510
<i>If she ever learns I saw her 
embarrassing herself this way,</i>

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.450
Please have your way with me!

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:05.560
<i>death would be the least of it!</i>

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.240
"Yeah, I'll mess you up good."

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:10.000
"As befits that pig's face of yours."

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:12.600
Julian-sama!

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:15.160
How could you? No!

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:17.360
<i>I-I'll escape while I can.</i>

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:22.000
<i>Sh-She caught me?</i>

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:22.950
<i>She didn't see, right?</i>

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:25.080
<i>Th-There's no one inside here!</i>

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:29.250
The whole world can just die.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.970
<i>What's this sudden change?!</i>

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:34.770
This thing is no more than 
a manufactured imitation.

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:37.340
I'm a fool for getting all worked up over it.

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.910
<i>While I do agree with you there,</i>

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:42.300
<i>what's with the sudden rise and fall of mood?</i>

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:46.790
Julian-sama...

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:49.480
Julian-sama...

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:50.430
<i>Huh?</i>

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:52.350
Loves me.

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:56.860
Loves me not. Loves me. Loves me not.

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:58.510
<i>Flower fortunetelling?</i>

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:01.940
<i>She's doing girly flower fortunetelling 
with stuffed animal heads?!</i>

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:05.070
Loves me.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:06.410
<i>She's coming this way!</i>

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:07.010
Loves me not.

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:08.270
Loves me.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:09.680
Loves me not.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.180
Loves me.

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:13.050
<i>No!</i>

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:13.080
Loves me n—

00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:15.330
Not...

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:17.730
Not!

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:19.090
Pardon me.

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:21.840
Why, you...

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:24.960
This is strange. The door won't open.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:25.390
<i>I-I'm saved?</i>

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:27.720
Won't open. Won't open.

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:27.240
<i>But who in the world...</i>

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:29.520
You airheads!

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:31.070
Don't rattle the door!

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:32.130
Please move.

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:33.440
I shall handle this.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:34.450
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:36.010
Proceeding at full force.

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:38.640
<i>This voice? No way.</i>

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:40.760
Stop—

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.570
<i>Wh-Wh-Wh-Wha?</i>

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:46.070
It's open.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.530
I propose improving the door fittings.

00:12:50.730 --> 00:12:51.690
Now, then...

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:53.760
Commencing morning cleaning.

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:56.320
<i>Why are they here?</i>

00:12:57.030 --> 00:12:59.270
<i>Rin-san! Luvia-san!</i>

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:09.130
Miyu-oneechan!

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.850
Erica? What is it?

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:15.700
I have a present for you today, Onee-chan!

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:16.940
Now, come in.

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:37.500
It was no good.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:41.090
I was sure Miyu-oneechan would like it...

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.290
Why did she end up crying?

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:47.510
Perhaps because she valued 
the mind, not the body?

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:49.950
Hmm, I see.

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:51.310
That's strange.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:53.850
Dolls are definitely better.

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:56.570
You prefer dolls, Erica-sama?

00:13:56.570 --> 00:13:57.230
Yeah.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:01.790
I like stuffed animals, too. 
But dolls can move and talk.

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:02.860
That makes them better!

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:05.130
I think so, as well.

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:07.810
However, it seems Miyu-sama 
didn't appreciate it.

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:10.200
Oh, well.

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:13.410
Next time, we'll bring her the stuffed animal.

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.120
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:19.490
<i>Rin-san and Luvia-san are safe.</i>

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:24.840
<i>That means everyone who 
was in the great cavern</i>

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:28.240
<i>back then was sent into this world.</i>

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:30.530
Commencing cleaning.

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:32.720
We shall thoroughly eliminate filth.

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:34.970
You airheads!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.350
This is full of trash.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.840
Disposing of all of it.

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:38.950
It's not trash!

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:41.730
Even without heads, the stuffed 
animals are my friends!

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:43.940
<i>Wait, huh?</i>

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:47.490
<i>Why are these two maids here?</i>

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:49.410
<i>Wow! What a difference!</i>

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:51.590
<i>No, no... It's not the time for that.</i>

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:53.670
<i>What I should be doing right now is...</i>

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:55.770
Trash will be disposed of.

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:56.500
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:58.470
<i>Hold on, Rin-san!</i>

00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:00.810
<i>Mine hasn't come off, so I'm not trash!</i>

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:02.490
Trash bag full.

00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:04.000
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:06.220
Cut it out already!

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:08.760
You two think you can have 
your way with my friends?

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:10.070
Screw you!

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:13.150
Especially this bear thing.
It doesn't have a single tear in it yet!

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:16.220
<i>I think the way you express 
your friendship is too warped!</i>

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:18.550
Listen, don't throw out my stuffed animals.

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:19.890
I'll repair them again.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:21.840
This is the greatest trash.

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:24.240
Ripping into pieces for disposal.

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:25.650
Julian-sama!

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:29.530
I'll never forgive either of you!

00:15:29.530 --> 00:15:30.860
Line up right there!

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:31.990
<i>Hey!</i>

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.660
I'll crush you both at—

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:38.760
Tsk.

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:41.500
I can't. If I hit them, they'll go back.

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:44.210
<i>Go back? What?</i>

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:46.540
Crap! Just get out of here!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:50.990
Throw the stuffed animals into Erica's room!

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:52.960
Then Angelica will fix them!

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:54.910
<i>H-Hooray!</i>

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:58.600
<i>For now, I've managed to escape 
that destructive girl's room!</i>

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:01.060
<i>Rin-san! Luvia-san!</i>

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:03.180
This...

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:05.230
...is not a stuffed animal.

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:07.850
<i>They noticed? Yes, I'm Illy—</i>

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:09.110
It's moving trash.

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:11.920
<i>I've been reduced to trash?!</i>

00:16:11.920 --> 00:16:16.070
<i>Uh, uh... If I move in a way that proves I'm me...</i>

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:19.870
<i>What kind of motions do I usually make?!</i>

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.390
<i>Right...</i>

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.160
<i>Please figure it out!</i>

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:28.930
I am

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:29.760
me!

00:16:30.190 --> 00:16:31.510
I'm Illya!

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:34.490
Huh? Just now...

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:37.050
I... I spoke?

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:37.820
Incredible.

00:16:37.820 --> 00:16:39.930
I don't understand how, but I'm incredible!

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:42.150
Now you understand, right? I'm—

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:43.270
It's talking trash.

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:46.770
Why won't you stop seeing me as trash?!

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:51.550
Their eyes are like those of my body.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:56.480
They both had their minds removed, like mine?

00:16:57.960 --> 00:17:01.000
Then where are their minds now?

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:03.080
This is trouble.

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:03.660
Huh?

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:06.240
I don't know how to sort talking trash.

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:08.140
Combustible? Noncombustible? Recyclable?

00:17:08.140 --> 00:17:09.100
Which is it?

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:11.020
Most things are combustible.

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:13.670
But if anything doesn't incinerate, 
we'll be yelled at.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.050
Hey, um...

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:16.790
Understood.

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:20.470
Then, to ensure incineration, 
I'll cut it into pieces for disposal.

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:23.980
These two...

00:17:25.060 --> 00:17:28.150
Even without minds, they still cause trouble!

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.720
We mustn't allow it to escape.

00:17:29.720 --> 00:17:30.570
Pursuing.

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:37.870
Huh?

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:40.730
Mind-oneechan's stuffed animal isn't here!

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:41.870
Why not?

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:45.380
Bea-chan must have taken it again...

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:47.340
Pardon us.

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:49.170
Releasing stuffed animals.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:51.880
Ah! Those are mine!

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:55.940
They're ripped again! I hate Bea-chan!

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:59.090
Please don't worry, Erica-sama. 
I shall fix them.

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:01.060
As many times as needed.

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:03.250
Okay.

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:04.820
Wait.

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:06.380
Hold still, and get ripped apart.

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:08.260
Talking trash will be disposed of.

00:18:07.470 --> 00:18:08.920
What is this commotion?

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:10.980
Currently disposing of talking trash.

00:18:12.580 --> 00:18:13.770
Whatever.

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:16.990
More importantly, how did the 
rat extermination go?

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:19.450
Currently in progress, as well.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:22.330
Traps and poisons are having no effect.

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.910
Then we shall have to capture them by hand.

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:29.080
Erica-sama, I am leaving for a moment.

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:31.100
I will repair your stuffed animals later.

00:18:31.100 --> 00:18:32.170
Okay.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.890
I... I ditched them?

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:50.380
I didn't know the castle had 
a loft. Thank goodness.

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:57.610
R-Rats?

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:58.800
That surprised me.

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:03.230
I guess a building this big 
would have some rats.

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:08.450
What do I do now?

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:11.850
Hmm, what was it?

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:14.960
I feel like I'm forgetting something important.

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:18.940
Again? Aren't there too many rats?

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:21.410
This is getting to be too gross—

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:30.310
No! A mountain of rats!

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:32.480
There are way too many!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.300
Is this a rat paradise?

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:35.820
Is this Ratland?!

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:39.280
So you finally managed to find me?

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:41.070
It spoke!

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:43.460
I suppose this is the end of my concealment.

00:19:43.460 --> 00:19:46.450
However, I shall not give up without a fight.

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:47.450
Huh?

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:49.410
I shall fight to the bitter end.

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:52.120
Wait! Is that voice...

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.330
Disperse!

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:56.750
Sapphire?

00:19:56.980 --> 00:19:59.400
Huh? Is that voice...

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.860
Illya-sama?

00:20:02.440 --> 00:20:04.400
Why do you look like that?

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.970
No, I should greet you first.

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.250
It has been a long time, Illya-sama.

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:12.690
I am very glad to see you again.

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:16.290
Before that, stop the rats!

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:21.470
Oh, right.

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:25.690
You contacted Ruby and told her 
you were hiding in the castle.

00:20:26.100 --> 00:20:28.540
With the help of these rats,

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.910
I awaited my chance here, in the loft.

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:32.080
However,

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:35.590
I never expected you to also be 
turned into a stuffed animal.

00:20:35.590 --> 00:20:39.450
"Also"? So Rin-san and Luvia-san were...

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.920
Have you seen them?

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:46.730
Their bodies appear to be in use as housemaids,

00:20:46.730 --> 00:20:49.040
but they completely fail at their tasks.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:52.150
And their hopeless, pathetic state 
has been difficult to watch.

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:55.120
<i>You really are Ruby's little sister...</i>

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:56.440
The loft. Go.

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:57.770
Understood.

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:00.680
Oh, no...

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:01.960
There's nowhere to run.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:04.970
Illya-sama, please grab hold of me.

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:05.780
Huh?

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:09.340
Kaleidosticks are powerless on their own, but...

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:10.870
Okay!

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.300
We can't fight on our own.

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:16.480
But together...

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:18.910
<i>Compact, Full Open.</i>

00:21:19.650 --> 00:21:21.900
<i>Mirror World Circuits: maximum engage.</i>

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:38.080
<i>Prisma Illya, Sapphire Version... Loaded!</i>

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:46.510
We can fight like this?

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:49.770
For now, we shall have to try our best.

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:35.970
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:21.420 --> 00:23:24.750
Servant Card, Include. Nameless, Shield.

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:28.170
Return that body at once!

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:31.090
Do you believe you cannot die in that body?

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:33.600
Are you all prepared to be villains?

00:23:32.530 --> 00:23:36.700
<b>People and Tools</b>

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:35.750
The goal of the Ainsworths is...
